/",{"_21":1374,"_23":1375,"_25":1376,"_115":1444,"_1164":1445,"_97":120,"_295":300,"_292":1438,"_9":1446,"_276":1447,"_20":1448,"_34":1449,"_251":1450,"_244":1451},[1380,1381,1382,1383,1384,1385,1386,1387,1388,1389,1390,1391,1392,1393,1394,1395,1396,1397,1398,1399],{"_55":23,"_59":1375,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":1376,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":1444,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":237,"_57":1161,"_283":1162,"_69":1439,"_61":1164,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":96,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":1438,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":1433,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":1429,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":1428,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":273,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":1424,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":1419,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":1414,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":1405,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":1404,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":1400,"_80":1401,"_90":1402,"_34":1403,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":236},{"_55":56,"_61":224,"_57":225,"_59":226,"_65":66},"The live Godot build: neon territory capture and moving enemies.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/tron-exonix-claude.webp","The neon TRON: EXONIX game board with a player vehicle, moving enemies, and territory boundaries.","https://www.top3d.ai/demo/exonix-build/index.html",[103],[1406,1407,1408,1409],{"_57":103,"_27":104},{"_57":355,"_27":356},{"_57":1412,"_27":1413},{"_57":1410,"_27":1411},"MCP for Blender","/zh/resources/mcp-for-blender/","Godot MCP · Coding-Solo","/zh/resources/godot-mcp/",[1415],{"_57":1416,"_27":1417,"_255":1418},"Read how the agent workflow was assembled","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix/blob/master/CLAUDE.md","The creator’s reproducible setup record explains the AI’s implementation work, human material review, generation tools, and local launch requirements.",[1420],{"_57":1421,"_27":1422,"_255":1423},"Open the complete Godot game project","https://github.com/witnesstodark/tron-exonix","Includes the Godot project, scripts, shaders, models, textures, audio, and generation scripts. Local play requires Godot 4.7 standard; API access is only needed to regenerate assets.",[1425],{"_57":1426,"_27":1403,"_255":1427},"Play TRON: EXONIX","Creator-hosted Godot web build. Click to enter the grid, press Space to deploy, use the arrow keys to move, and Escape for the menu. A keyboard and a WebGL-capable browser are recommended.","教程",[1430],{"_57":1431,"_27":1432,"_255":-7},"Follow the creator’s complete workflow","https://www.top3d.ai/learn/claude-godot-mcp-3d-game",[1434,1435,1436,1437],"Play the web build and study territory capture, trail hazards, enemy movement, and sector progression.","Follow the creator’s tutorial from prototype through materials, audio, effects, and web export.","Read CLAUDE.md to understand the agent, Godot MCP, Blender review, and asset-generation workflow.","Open game/project.godot in Godot 4.7 and press F5; study the scripts alongside the included models, textures, and audio.","作者记录 Claude 编写玩法、着色器、视觉特效和 UI，人工引导机制与材质。仓库包含实际 Godot 游戏、生成资产及资产生成脚本。",[1136,1440,1441,1165,1442,1443],"Nano Banana","PATINA","Stable Audio","ElevenLabs","Godot 4.7 · GDScript",[1136,1440,1441,1165,1442,1443],[1434,1435,1436,1437],{"_57":1431,"_27":1432,"_19":276},{"_57":1426,"_27":1403,"_19":266,"_255":1427},{"_57":1421,"_27":1422,"_308":309,"_255":1423},{"_57":1416,"_27":1417,"_255":1418},[125,390,1452,1453],"godot-mcp","mcp-for-blender","example:arkanoid-neon-claude","arkanoid-neon-claude","Arkanoid Neon","让球反弹穿过八种霓虹砖块布局，收集强化道具，并应对逐渐加快的节奏。这款完整浏览器游戏使用 Canvas 2D 与实时合成的 Web Audio。","/zh/examples