okemon-tactics","Complete pnpm workspace with game core, Pokemon data, Babylon renderer, UI and app assets. package.json requires Node >=24 and pnpm 10.32.1; pnpm install then pnpm dev. Code MIT; many sprites/tiles use CC BY-NC 4.0 and some effect particles have no separate license. Noncommercial fan project; read CREDITS.md.",[1643],{"_57":1644,"_27":1645,"_255":1646},"Play Pokemon Tactics","https://kekel87.itch.io/pokemon-tactics","Author-hosted browser demo on itch.io; choose Run game. Includes AI opponents and hot-seat play. An in-development fan project.","itch.io",[1649],{"_57":1650,"_27":1636,"_255":-7},"阅读作者的开发说明",[1652,1653,1654,1655],"Play a battle against the built-in opponents and test movement, height, type matchups and friendly fire.","Read the AI disclosure and CREDITS.md before exploring the engine and rendering packages.","Use Node 24 or later and pnpm 10.32.1 to run the complete workspace locally.","Change one tactical rule with an agent, then compare battle resolution, team setup and replay behavior.","作者负责设计与架构，Claude Code 与专门代理编写大部分代码、测试和文档。宝可梦数据、精灵图及部分 PixelLab 美术另有署名与使用条件，不能与代码许可混为一谈。","Babylon.js · TypeScript",[1652,1653,1654,1655],{"_57":1664,"_27":1636,"_19":448},{"_57":1644,"_27":1645,"_19":266,"_255":1646},{"_57":391,"_27":1640,"_255":1641,"_308":309},{"_57":1597,"_27":1636,"_255":1637},[125],"Read the creator’s development disclosure","example:castle-clash-duel-claude","castle-clash-duel-claude","Castle Clash Duel","招募战士与弓箭手，在瓦片地图上进行双人战术对抗。这个完整 Phaser 原型由 Claude Code 实现，并使用 Pixel Frog 制作的 Tiny Swords 美术素材。","/zh/examples/castle-clash-duel-claude/",{"_21":1666,"_23":1667,"_25":1668,"_115":1724,"_97":299,"_295":300,"_292":1723,"_9":1725,"_276":1726,"_20":1727,"_34":1728,"_251":1729,"_244":1730},[1672,1673,1674,1675,1676,1677,1678,1679,1680,1681,1682,1683,1684,1685,1686,1687,1688,1689,1690,1691],{"_55":23,"_59":1667,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":119,"_59":1668,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":1724,"_61":115,"_63":6