was found; artwork retains Pixel Frog terms. Do not assume unrestricted reuse.",[1711],{"_57":1712,"_27":1713,"_255":1714},"Play Castle Clash Duel","https://vibe-tiny-swords.vercel.app/","Author-linked browser prototype with mouse or touch controls. The local public/index.html loads Phaser 3.70.0 from a CDN.",[1716],{"_57":1717,"_27":1698,"_255":-7},"查看从 PRD 到游戏的开发流程",[1719,1720,1721,1722],"Play a two-player battle and identify recruitment, movement, attacks and castle victory conditions.","Read the published PRD and technical design before tracing the game’s single-file scene logic.","Inspect the Tiny Swords asset metadata and the custom panels used to handle sprite padding.","Change one unit or UI rule with an agent, then replay the battle and inspect the included test harness.","作者先准备需求文档、技术设计与素材元数据，再使用三个 Claude Code 技能实现 Phaser 玩法、地图和前端测试。美术是另行署名的人工作品；当前项目仍是原型。","Phaser 3 · JavaScript",[1719,1720,1721,1722],{"_57":1731,"_27":1698,"_19":310},{"_57":1712,"_27":1713,"_19":266,"_255":1714},{"_57":391,"_27":1708,"_255":1709,"_308":309},{"_57":1597,"_27":1698,"_255":1705},[125,307],"Read the PRD-to-game workflow","example:morbreaker-unity-claude","morbreaker-unity-claude","morBreaker","用挡板引导不断加速的小球，挑战十个难度递增的打砖块关卡，包含多段耐久砖块与本地高分记录。","/zh/examples/morbreaker-unity-claude/",{"_21":1733,"_23":1734,"_25":1735,"_115":1791,"_97":299,"_295":300,"_292":1790,"_9":1792,"_276":1793,"_20":1794,"_34":1795,"_251":1796,"_244":1797},[1739,1740,1741,1742,1743,1744,1745,1746,1747,1748,1749,1750,1751,1752,1753,1754,1755,1756,1757],{"_55":23,"_59":1734,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":1735,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":1791,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":296,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":1790,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":1785,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":1782,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,