ed; no public hosted play link is supplied.",[1783],{"_57":1784,"_27":1771,"_255":-7},"阅读作者的 Unity 与 Claude Code 开发记录",[1786,1787,1788,1789],"Download the Windows release or serve the published WebGL build over HTTP.","Try paddle steering, acceleration, loss, restart, and the local score list.","Read the creator’s Claude Code disclosure and inspect the gameplay C# scripts.","Open SampleScene.unity with Unity 6000.4.11f1, change one level rule, and test progression.","KingMordas 说明几乎整个游戏由 Claude Code 通过 Unity MCP 插件完成，包括玩法脚本、场景与预制体连接、测试及文档。AI 编辑工具与发布游戏的运行环境相互独立。","Unity 6 · URP · C#",[1786,1787,1788,1789],{"_57":1801,"_27":1771,"_19":448},{"_57":1779,"_27":1780,"_19":367,"_255":1781},{"_57":1800,"_27":1761,"_308":309,"_255":1776},{"_57":1799,"_27":1771,"_255":1772},[1798,125],"unity-engine","Read the explicit Claude Code contribution breakdown","Open the complete Unity game","Read the creator’s Unity and Claude Code account","example:deep-yellow-claude","deep-yellow-claude","DEEP YELLOW","在程序生成的后室中探索。这是一款第一人称回合制 Roguelike：移动或等待会触发战斗，装备组合与理智值共同影响每次冒险。","/zh/examples/deep-yellow-claude/",{"_21":1803,"_23":1804,"_25":1805,"_115":1868,"_97":120,"_295":300,"_292":1867,"_9":1869,"_276":1870,"_20":1871,"_34":1872,"_251":1873,"_244":1874,"_852":1875},[1809,1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829],{"_55":23,"_59":1804,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":1805,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":1868,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":96,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":1867,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":1862,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":1859,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":275,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":1647,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":1855,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":850,"_69":1851,"_61":852,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":1846,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":1841,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":1838,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":1837,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":1833,"_80":1834,"_90":1835,"_34":1836,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":350},{"_55":56,"_61":344,"_57":345,"_59":1484,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_61":339,"_57":340,"_69":1830},[1831],{"_57":340,"_27":1832},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNDA2ODk3Ni8yNTU4NTg5NS5wbmc=/original/HZA7lO.png","The author’s Godot play-mode screenshot, retaining the original editor and debug panels.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/deep-yellow-claude.webp","A first-person yellow-corridor encounter with a held bat, inventory and minimap, inside the creator’s captured Godot editor.","https://aebrer.itch.io/deep-yellow",[103],[1839,1840],{"_57":355,"_27":356},{"_57":103,"_27":104},[1842],{"_57":1843,"_27":1844,"_255":1845},"查看 Claude Code 开发署名","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/blob/master/CREDITS.md#code-and-design","Creator attribution specifically names Claude via Claude Code. The itch page separately discloses AI assistance for code; no complete session transcript is supplied.",[1847],{"_57":1848,"_27":1849,"_255":1850},"查看完整 Godot 游戏","https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow","Full Godot 4.6 project, scenes, scripts, assets, shaders, and export presets. The itch page lists code MIT and assets CC0, while CREDITS.md still leaves the original-code license undecided and some third-party licenses unspecified; inspect both before reuse.",[1852],{"_57":373,"_27":1853,"_255":1854},"https://github.com/aebrer/deep-yellow/releases/tag/v0.13.0","Download — Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.",[1856],{"_57":1857,"_27":1836,"_255":1858},"Play DEEP YELLOW","In-development browser build plus Windows/Linux downloads. The creator recommends Chrome or a controller; Firefox mouse input has known problems. Includes horror themes and an interactive tutorial.",[1860],{"_57":1861,"_27":1836,"_255":-7},"阅读作者的游戏与开发笔记",[1863,1864,1865,1866],"Play the interactive tutorial and compare moving, waiting, equipment, and sanity.","Read the creator’s AI disclosure and the project’s separate attribution file.","Import project.godot in Godot 4.6 and inspect the start menu, procedural levels, and turn systems.","Change one equipment or turn rule, then test a complete run and restart.","Drew Brereton 明确说明游戏代码由 Claude 辅助开发。项目署名进一步指出使用了 Claude Code，并将原创内容与外部着色器、纹理和字体分开列出。","Godot 4.6 · GDScript",[1863,1864,1865,1866],{"_57":1880,"_27":1836,"_19":310},{"_57":1857,"_27":1836,"_19":266,"_255":1858},{"_57":1879,"_27":1849,"_308":309,"_255":1850},{"_57":1878,"_27":1844,"_255":1845},[390,125],[1876],{"_880":373,"_27":1853,"_19":367,"_255":1877},"Prepared Windows and Linux builds, plus a self-hostable Web export. These are uploaded game builds, separate from automatic source archives. Release files were verified; native builds were not executed.","Read the explicit Claude Code credit","Open the complete Godot game","Read the creator’s game and development notes","example:pelican-bike-claude","pelican-bike-claude","Pelican on a Bike：鹈鹕骑单车","让戴着头盔的鹈鹕沿程序化海岸骑行，变道抓鱼、跳跃并解锁小成就。完整 Three.js 工程包含角色、单车、海洋、音频与昼夜系统。","/zh/examples/pelican-bike-claude/",{"_21":1882,"_23":1883,"_25":1884,"_115":165,"_97":120,"_295":300,"_292":1936,"_9":1937,"_276":1938,"_20":1939,"_34":1940,"_251":1941,"_244":1942},[1889,1890,1891,1892,1893,1894,1895,1896,1897,1898,1899,1900,1901,1902,1903,1904,1905,1906,1907],"Pelican on a Bike",{"_55":23,"_59":1883,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":119,"_59":1884,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":165,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":96,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":1936,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":1931,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":1928,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":861,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":273,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":1924,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":1920,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":1916,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":1913,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":1912,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":1908,"_80":1909,"_90":1910,"_34":1911,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":236},{"_55":56,"_61":224,"_57":225,"_59":1484,"_65":66},"The live coastal ride after acceleration, a first jump and a camera change.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/pelican-bike-claude.webp","A white pelican riding a bicycle along a three-dimensional coast, with speed, distance, fish and achievement HUD.","https://claude-opus-5-5.riba2534.cn/",[103],[1914,1915],{"_57":103,"_27":104},{"_57":705,"_27":706},[1917],{"_57":1567,"_27":1918,"_255":1919},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo#readme","Creator-published prompt and session summary, with exact Claude Code attribution. The model-led long-run tests described there were not repeated by GameMap.",[1921],{"_57":364,"_27":1922,"_255":1923},"https://github.com/riba2534/claude-opus-5-5-demo/tree/main/pelican-bike","Complete pelican-bike source, build script and procedural assets. Run npm install and node build.mjs in that subdirectory, then open dist/index.html. The repository contains three distinct games; this case selects only the pelican game. Package metadata names ISC, but no repository-wide licence text is supplied.",[1925],{"_57":1926,"_27":1911,"_255":1927},"试玩鹈鹕骑单车","Keyboard and touch controls; W/S accelerate/brake, A/D change lanes, Space jumps and C changes camera. A muted entry is available. Desktop launch, acceleration, jump achievement and camera change were checked.",[1929],{"_57":1930,"_27":1918,"_255":-7},"阅读原始提示词与开发记录",[1932,1933,1934,1935],"Start a muted ride, accelerate with W/S, change lanes with A/D and jump with Space.","Compare the published one-sentence prompt with the pelican, bicycle, cloth, ocean and camera modules.","In pelican-bike, install dependencies and run node build.mjs; open the resulting dist/index.html in a browser.","Change one collection or cycling rule, then check movement, jump, score feedback and restart.","作者说明使用 Claude Code 中的 Claude Opus 5.5，从一句中文提示开始生成游戏。README 公开提示词，并记录模型进行浏览器测试及后续修复的过程；“人工未改代码”是作者自述，并非独立测量的创作比例。",[1932,1933,1934,1935],{"_57":1944,"_27":1918,"_19":861},{"_57":1943,"_27":1911,"_19":266,"_255":1927},{"_57":391,"_27":1922,"_308":309,"_255":1923},{"_57":1597,"_27":1918,"_255":1919},[125,736],"Play Pelican on a Bike","Read the original prompt and development account","example:minimal-rogue-claude","minimal-rogue-claude","Minimal Rogue","探索黑白地牢、打碎方块，管理体力和装备，逐层深入 ASCII 风格的肉鸽冒险。游戏提供英文和日文界面。","/zh/examples/minimal-rogue-claude/",{"_21":1946,"_23":1947,"_25":1948,"_115":1999,"_97":299,"_295":528,"_292":1998,"_9":1993,"_276":2000,"_20":2001,"_34":2002,"_251":2003,"_244":2004},[1952,1953,1954,1955,1956,1957,1958,1959,1960,1961,1962,1963,1964,1965,1966,1967,1968,1969,1970],{"_55":23,"_59":1947,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":1948,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":1999,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":296,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":526,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":1998,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":1993,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":1990,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":448,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":1647,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":1986,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":1982,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":1978,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":1976,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":1975,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":1971,"_80":1972,"_90":1973,"_34":1974,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":236},{"_55":56,"_61":224,"_57":225,"_59":1484,"_65":66},"The live first-floor room after normal movement and block-cracking inputs.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/minimal-rogue-claude.webp","Minimal Rogue first-floor gameplay with the player, breakable blocks, corridor, HP and stamina HUD, and block-cracking log.","https://hirotaka-adachi.itch.io/minimal-rogue",[103],[1977],{"_57":103,"_27":104},[1979],{"_57":1980,"_27":1974,"_255":1981},"Read the author’s Claude Code and SUNO attribution","The creator identifies Claude Code for development, SUNO AI for music, links the complete repository and explicitly describes the work as created entirely using AI. No model version or full development transcript is supplied.",[1983],{"_57":364,"_27":1984,"_255":1985},"https://github.com/HirotakaAdachi/Rogue/tree/anonymous-release","Complete static HTML/CSS/JavaScript project and four MP3 tracks; serve the root over HTTP without a package install or build step. MIT code license is included; SUNO music is credited without a separate music license. The reviewed public source index references script version 549, while the itch build references 581, so the two releases are not claimed to be byte-identical.",[1987],{"_57":1988,"_27":1974,"_255":1989},"Play Minimal Rogue on itch.io","Browser keyboard game. Enter confirms the opening and tutorial; arrows move, Space defends, and X opens the menu. A short first-floor run verified movement, block-cracking feedback and the command menu. Later floors, saves and a complete run were not tested.",[1991],{"_57":1992,"_27":1974,"_255":-7},"Read the creator’s AI and source-code notes",[1994,1995,1996,1997],"运行网页游戏，选择新游戏与语言，用 Enter 推进开场和教程。","用方向键探索首个房间，Space 防御，X 打开指令菜单。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，检查完整 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 和音乐文件。","通过 HTTP 提供源码目录，修改一项房间或体力规则，检查移动、交互和新一局流程。","Hirotaka Adachi 将开发工具归为 Claude Code，音乐归为 SUNO AI，并称作品完全由 AI 制作，但没有给出确切编程模型。公开项目包含渲染器、规则、界面和四首音乐；作者的这一表述不等于没有人工指导的自主开发。","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI",{"_57":1992,"_27":1974,"_19":448},{"_57":1988,"_27":1974,"_19":266,"_255":1989},{"_57":391,"_27":1984,"_308":309,"_255":1985},{"_57":1980,"_27":1974,"_255":1981},[125],"example:polar-icecapade-claude","polar-icecapade-claude","Polar Icecapade","在冰面 3D 场景中滑行，用三段近战连击向前推进，射击时利用后坐力向后移动。穿过闸门、收集金币，在短篇 Game Jam 冒险中对抗老鼠政权。","/zh/examples/polar-icecapade-claude/",{"_21":2006,"_23":2007,"_25":2008,"_115":2065,"_97":120,"_295":300,"_292":2061,"_1164":2066,"_9":2056,"_276":2067,"_20":2068,"_34":2069,"_251":2070,"_244":2071},[2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026,2027,2028,2029,2030,2031],{"_55":23,"_59":2007,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":2008,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":2065,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":237,"_57":1161,"_283":1162,"_69":2062,"_61":1164,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":96,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":2061,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":2056,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":2053,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":275,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":1647,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":2049,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":2045,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":2041,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":2037,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":2036,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":2032,"_80":2033,"_90":2034,"_34":2035,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":236},{"_55":56,"_61":224,"_57":225,"_59":1484,"_65":66},"The live first level after melee movement and a shot; ammo has fallen to 11/12.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/polar-icecapade-claude.webp","Polar Icecapade’s first icy 3D arena after melee propulsion and a shot, showing the moving character, gates, coins, timer and 11 of 12 ammunition.","https://evankurtzart.itch.io/polar-icecapade",[103],[2038,2039,2040],{"_57":103,"_27":104},{"_57":355,"_27":356},{"_57":1136,"_27":1137},[2042],{"_57":2043,"_27":2035,"_255":2044},"Read the team’s explicit Claude Code assistance statement","The creators distinguish AI help with diagnosing and implementing core code from their own code review, modeling, animation and art. The page links the full game source and identifies Godot 4.6 and GDScript; its “No generative AI” content badge does not erase the separate coding-assistance disclosure.",[2046],{"_57":1421,"_27":2047,"_255":2048},"https://github.com/afenkurtz/Big-Mode-Game-Jam-2026/tree/main/slick","Complete Godot 4.6 project with levels, GDScript, GLB/FBX models, Blender authoring files, textures, UI and audio. The inspected tree has 292 files, about 239 MB. Open the slick folder; importing Blender authoring files may require a compatible Blender installation. No top-level game license was found; external sounds, music and fonts retain their separately credited terms.",[2050],{"_57":2051,"_27":2035,"_255":2052},"Play or download Polar Icecapade on itch.io","Mouse recommended: left-click performs melee propulsion, right-click shoots with recoil, and Escape pauses. Browser review reached the first level, moved, fired a projectile with ammo changing from 12 to 11, and opened pause. The roughly 170 MB web build has author-documented performance limits; Windows/Linux downloads are provided and mobile is not recommended. Later levels and a complete run were not tested.",[2054],{"_57":2055,"_27":2035,"_255":-7},"Read the team’s development and asset breakdown",[2057,2058,2059,2060],"使用鼠标开始网页首关，测试冰面滑行和近战连击推进。","右键射击，对比向后的后坐力与近战向前推进。","阅读团队对 Claude Code 的说明，以及人工美术、动画和音频署名。","在 Godot 4.6 中打开 slick 工程，修改一项移动或闸门规则，检查首个房间、弹药、暂停与重开。","Aidan “Botodo” Connolly 和 Evan Kurtz 说明 Claude Code 帮助诊断问题、实现困难的核心逻辑，之后他们检查并调整了全部代码。建模、绑定、动画和设计由团队完成，音频另有署名；作者明确说明没有用生成式 AI 制作资产，也未给出编程模型版本。",[1136,2063,2064],"Procreate","Affinity","Godot 4.6 · GDScript · 3D",[1136,2063,2064],{"_57":2055,"_27":2035,"_19":310},{"_57":2051,"_27":2035,"_19":266,"_255":2052},{"_57":1421,"_27":2047,"_308":309,"_255":2048},{"_57":2043,"_27":2035,"_255":2044},[125,390,1174],"example:overexposed-ai","overexposed-ai","Overexposed","通过卡牌选择，引导一位初露头角的艺人度过一年的职业生涯。平衡技艺、金钱和关注度，观察三家报纸的反应，避免过高热度引发丑闻。","/zh/examples/overexposed-ai/",{"_21":2073,"_23":2074,"_25":2075,"_115":2137,"_97":299,"_295":300,"_292":2134,"_9":2129,"_276":2138,"_20":2139,"_34":2140,"_251":2141,"_244":2142,"_1164":2143},[2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099],{"_55":23,"_59":2074,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":2075,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":2137,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":237,"_57":1161,"_283":1162,"_69":2135,"_61":1164,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":296,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":2134,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":2129,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":2125,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":2124,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":1647,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":2120,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":2115,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":2111,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":2108,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":2107,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":2103,"_80":2104,"_90":2105,"_34":2106,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":350},{"_55":56,"_61":344,"_57":345,"_59":1484,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_61":339,"_57":340,"_69":2100},[2101],{"_57":340,"_27":2102},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTA3MzQwMi8zMTAxNTIwOS5wbmc=/original/pgaZBa.png","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io game page.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp","Overexposed’s desktop card table with newspapers, career cards, money, fame, craft, heat and an End Turn control.","https://eg30.itch.io/overexposed",[103,427],[2109,2110],{"_57":103,"_27":104},{"_57":432,"_27":433},[2112],{"_57":2113,"_27":2106,"_255":2114},"Read the creator’s AI contribution and asset disclosure","The author names Claude Code and OpenAI Codex and explains human editing of text. README confirms AI-assisted commits with Co-Authored-By trailers; CREDITS.md explains procedural pictures/effects and the separate music/font sources.",[2116],{"_57":2117,"_27":2118,"_255":2119},"Open the complete career-simulation project","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed","Complete TypeScript/React project with the rule engine, content, UI drawings, procedural sound, six music files, fonts, balance simulator and browser checks. Node.js >=22.18; npm install, npm run dev or npm run build. No explicit software license is provided, so public source availability does not establish reuse rights. Bundled fonts are OFL 1.1 and Holizna music is CC0; see CREDITS.md.",[2121],{"_57":2122,"_27":2106,"_255":2123},"Play Overexposed on itch.io","Browser playtest build, best on a landscape desktop screen. Uses mouse or touch; cards show effects on hover or long press. Begin, opening text and manager choice reached the live card desk in Chrome. The complete year, all endings and touch play were not tested; the hosted build is not claimed to match the latest repository revision.","quickstart",[2126],{"_57":2127,"_27":2128,"_255":-7},"Read the game’s source and local run commands","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed#readme",[2130,2131,2132,2133],"打开 itch.io 网页版本，依次选择 Begin、Continue 并签约经纪人。","选择开局卡牌，观察桌面、资源和报纸如何回应。","阅读作者 AI 披露、README 和 CREDITS.md，区分程序化美术、音效与第三方音乐。","使用 Node.js 22.18+ 执行 npm install、npm run dev，沿 content/cards.json、core/reducer.ts 和 React 桌面阅读规则，再测试一整年。","EG30 负责设计、方向和写作，使用 Claude Code 与 OpenAI Codex 实现游戏，并亲自修改 AI 辅助起草的文本。美术和音效通过代码绘制或合成；Holizna 背景音乐另有 CC0 署名。",[2136],"Canvas 2D (procedural halftone art)","DOM/CSS + SVG · React UI",{"_57":2127,"_27":2128,"_19":2124},{"_57":2122,"_27":2106,"_19":266,"_255":2123},{"_57":2117,"_27":2118,"_308":309,"_255":2119},{"_57":2113,"_27":2106,"_255":2114},[125,465],[2136],"example:katana-kitsune-godot","katana-kitsune-godot","Katana Kitsune: Prototype","选择狐妖剑士，在等距视角的动作肉鸽中迎战妖怪、管理体力、拾取道具并深入地牢。这个无声原型支持本地多人，当前源码还记录了后续队伍系统。","/zh/examples/katana-kitsune-godot/",{"_21":2145,"_23":2146,"_25":2147,"_115":2217,"_97":299,"_295":300,"_292":2211,"_1164":2218,"_9":2206,"_276":2219,"_20":2220,"_34":2221,"_251":2222,"_244":2223},[2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171],{"_55":23,"_59":2146,"_61":23,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":2147,"_61":25,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":297,"_59":2217,"_61":115,"_63":64,"_65":66},{"_55":237,"_57":1161,"_283":1162,"_69":2212,"_61":1164,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":95,"_59":296,"_61":97,"_63":98,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":293,"_59":294,"_61":295,"_63":94,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":290,"_59":2211,"_61":292,"_63":64,"_65":37},{"_55":237,"_57":282,"_283":284,"_69":2206,"_61":9,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":67,"_57":277,"_69":2202,"_61":276,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":274,"_59":275,"_61":276,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":56,"_57":272,"_59":1647,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":267,"_69":2198,"_61":20,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":265,"_59":266,"_61":20,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":259,"_69":2194,"_61":34,"_63":-7},{"_55":56,"_57":257,"_59":258,"_61":34,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_57":249,"_69":2189,"_61":251,"_63":-7},{"_55":67,"_57":242,"_69":2181,"_61":244,"_63":-7},{"_55":237,"_61":238,"_57":239,"_69":2179,"_65":66},{"_55":227,"_61":123,"_57":2175,"_80":2176,"_90":2177,"_34":2178,"_232":233,"_234":235,"_62":350},{"_55":56,"_61":344,"_57":345,"_59":1484,"_65":66},{"_55":67,"_61":339,"_57":340,"_69":2172},[2173],{"_57":340,"_27":2174},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png","Creator-published combat screenshot from the silent Godot prototype.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/katana-kitsune-godot.webp","The creator’s Katana Kitsune combat screenshot with an isometric courtyard, the party, enemies, health bars and minimap.","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune/blob/bc9321eeaac727bbb5372a315ec58f68c96240ac/marketing/itch/05_attack.png",[103,2180],"GitHub Copilot",[2182,2183,2184,2185,2186],{"_57":103,"_27":104},{"_57":355,"_27":356},{"_57":501,"_27":502},{"_57":2187,"_27":2188},{"_57":1136,"_27":1137},"Meshy API","/zh/resources/meshy/",[2190],{"_57":2191,"_27":2192,"_255":2193},"Read the creator’s AI production disclosure","https://9-k9.itch.io/katanakitsune","The author explicitly names Claude Code and GitHub Copilot alongside image, sprite and 3D asset tools, and links the primary complete source repository. The README verifies the Godot version and explains which finished assets are included.",[2195],{"_57":1421,"_27":2196,"_255":2197},"https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune","Godot 4.7 project with scenes, GDScript, Dialogic addon and finished sprite assets. The inspected tree contains about 383 MB of files; no top-level game license was found. The upstream Meshy/Blender/PixelOver authoring pipeline is separate, while its finished runtime sprites are committed. The current source contains newer party/asset changes than the reviewed hosted prototype.",[2199],{"_57":2200,"_27":2192,"_255":2201},"Play Katana Kitsune on itch.io","Silent HTML5 prototype with keyboard and gamepad support. Space confirms player/device choices; allow a clear press and release between setup steps. The browser build loaded and reached player/device selection in review; combat and a complete dungeon run were not exercised. The download is large: about 184 MB of game data plus 40 MB of WebAssembly.",[2203],{"_57":2204,"_27":2205,"_255":-7},"Read the game and asset-pipeline documentation","https://github.com/9-K9/KatanaKitsune#readme",[2207,2208,2209,2210],"打开 itch 原型，选择一名真人玩家，认领键盘并选择服装。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，以及角色、战斗和精灵制作流程说明。","在 Godot 4.7 中通过 GL Compatibility 打开 project.godot；工程已包含可运行精灵和游戏场景。","调整一项战斗或生成参数，检查标题、选角、地牢、受伤和重开的完整衔接。","作者明确列出 Claude Code、GitHub Copilot、GPT Image 2、PixelLab 和 Meshy 等制作工具。仓库记录了 Meshy 绑定动画、Blender 重定向和 PixelOver 精灵导出流程；没有说明确切编程模型或各助手的代码分工。游戏里的 NPC 队友并不是 AI 辅助开发的证据。",[2213,2214,2215,1136,2216],"GPT Image 2","PixelLab","Meshy","PixelOver","Godot 4.7 · GDScript · 2D / GL Compatibility",[2213,2214,2215,1136,2216],{"_57":2204,"_27":2205,"_19":310},{"_57":2200,"_27":2192,"_19":266,"_255":2201},{"_57":1421,"_27":2196,"_308":309,"_255":2197},{"_57":2191,"_27":2192,"_255":2193},[125,390,535,2224,1174],"meshy","resource:claude-code","resource","支持读取项目、修改代码、调用工具，以及技能包、Hooks 和 MCP 的终端与 IDE 编程代理。","/zh/resources/",{"_21":125,"_2290":103,"_295":2291,"_55":2292,"_2289":2227,"_2284":2283,"_27":2281,"_67":2293,"_2269":2294,"_2262":2295,"_2258":2296,"_2255":226},[2232,2233,2234,2235,2236,2237,2238,2239,2240,2241,2242,2243,2244],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_55":23,"_59":103,"_61":2290,"_63":-7,"_65":66},{"_55":119,"_59":2227,"_61":2289,"_63":-7,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":2287,"_59":2288,"_61":295,"_63":98,"_65":37},{"_55":56,"_57":2285,"_59":2286,"_61":55,"_63":98,"_65":37},{"_55":56,